  "visualBrief": "Pale Manueline square tower with recessed upper chapel, projecting machicolated roofwalk and Christ-cross shield merlons; fluted domed bartizans and beaded finials. Distinct north paired balconies and seven-arch south river loggia, royal shield and Madonna canopy. Native polygonal river bastion with16 recessed gunports, actual lower open court, pierced quatrefoil rails/pinnacles, tidal foundation and narrow L-shaped elevated steel/wood entrance bridge.",
